    "excerpt": "Connect. Collaborate. Expand. Grow Beyond Borders.",
    "content": "<!--[indiglobal-meta:{\"titleDescription\":\"Unlocking cross-border partnerships, trade corridors, and buyer-seller delegations at the landmark India–ASEAN Confluence 2027.\",\"tabTitle\":\"India–ASEAN Global Confluence 2027 | IndiGlobal Expo\",\"tabDescription\":\"Discover how India–ASEAN Global Confluence 2027 connects Indian businesses with Southeast Asian buyers, distributors and partners on 21–22 January 2027 in Thailand.\",\"titleOG\":\"India–ASEAN Global Confluence 2027 | IndiGlobal Expo\",\"descriptionOG\":\"Discover how India–ASEAN Global Confluence 2027 connects Indian businesses with Southeast Asian buyers, distributors and partners on 21–22 January 2027 in Thailand.\"}]-->\n\n**Building Bridges for Trade, Investment and Regional Growth**\n\n[align=justify]\n[India–ASEAN Global Confluence 2027](https://indiglobalexpo.com/) aims to strengthen business relationships between India and Southeast Asia by creating opportunities for trade, investment, collaboration and international market expansion. The exhibition in Bangkok, Thailand, will provide a platform for businesses, manufacturers, exporters, investors, distributors and industry professionals to explore emerging opportunities across the region.\n[/align]\n\n[align=justify]\n India and ASEAN countries share strong potential for economic cooperation across multiple sectors, including healthcare, pharmaceuticals, medical devices, information technology, manufacturing, agriculture, food processing, renewable energy, logistics and consumer goods. These industries offer promising opportunities for companies seeking new customers, reliable distribution networks and strategic international partnerships.\n[/align]\n\n[align=justify]\nFor Indian businesses planning to expand into Southeast Asian markets, understanding local regulations, product registration procedures, import requirements, pricing strategies and customer preferences is essential. Establishing connections with local distributors, importers and business partners can help companies navigate market-entry challenges and build sustainable export operations. At the same time, ASEAN businesses can explore India's growing consumer market, manufacturing capabilities and technological expertise.\n[/align]\n\n[align=justify]\nThe Confluence will encourage business networking, knowledge exchange and discussions on market access, supply-chain development, investment opportunities and regional economic cooperation. Participating companies can showcase their products and services, connect with potential buyers, identify business partners and explore possibilities for joint ventures and long-term collaboration.\n[/align]\n\n[align=justify]\nBeyond trade and investment, stronger India–ASEAN partnerships can support innovation, knowledge sharing and resilient regional supply chains. Businesses that understand local market requirements and develop trusted relationships will be better positioned to compete internationally.\n[/align]\n\n[align=justify]\nTaking place on 21–22 January 2027 in Bangkok, Thailand, [India–ASEAN Global Confluence 2027](https://indiglobalexpo.com/) aims to bring businesses closer to the opportunities emerging across Southeast Asia. By connecting Indian enterprises with regional markets and industry stakeholders, the event seeks to encourage meaningful partnerships, facilitate cross-border trade and support sustainable business growth.\n[/align]\n\n**For More Information, Contact Us or Visit Our Website:**\n🌐 Website: [https://indiglobalexpo.com/](https://indiglobalexpo.com/)\n\n[align=justify]\nJoin us at [India–ASEAN Global Confluence 2027](https://indiglobalexpo.com/) on **21–22 January 2027 in Bangkok, Thailand,** to explore new business opportunities, build strategic partnerships, and expand your reach across Southeast Asian markets.\n[/align]\n",
